==Strategy==
In all three chapters, none of the enemies prove to have any form of pushing power, so a consistent line of strong attackers like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cats]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cats]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cats]] will be enough to take this stage down. If you have [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]], [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]], and/or [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]], they make this stage even easier.

